# Copy to .env (gitignored). The key is only ever read by the API process;
# the browser never sees it.
#
# Two ways to authenticate:
#
#   1. An API key — what a deployment uses. Uncomment and fill in:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
#   2. `ant auth login` — an OAuth profile for local development, no key file.
#      Leave ANTHROPIC_API_KEY commented out: a key that is set (even an empty
#      or placeholder one) takes precedence and the profile is never consulted.

# Optional.
# NEON_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-site.vercel.app
# MCP_ALLOWED_HOSTS=your-api.onrender.com
